flowchart LR
    lidar[LiDAR / Point Cloud] --> map[Local Elevation / PGTT Map]
    map --> geom10[V10 First Riser B/H/D]
    map --> geom11[V11 Two-Riser B1/H1/D1 + B2/H2/D2]

    official[Official M20 57D Proprioception + Command] --> actor10[V10 60D Actor]
    geom10 --> actor10
    actor10 --> action[16D M20 Action: 12 Joint Targets + 4 Wheel Speeds]

    official --> actor11[V11/V11-FD/V12 63D Actor]
    geom11 --> actor11
    actor11 --> action

    map --> reward[V11/V12 Reward and Critic Side Geometry]
    reward --> ppo[RSL-RL PPO]
    ppo --> actor11

    actor11 --> deploy[Deployable Policy ABI]
    deploy --> robot[M20 PRO Wheel-Leg Locomotion]

    subgraph v11_state[V11 Landing State]
        clearance[Clearance Escrow]
        crossing[Face Crossing]
        support[Upper-Tread Support]
        collision[Confirmed Front-Riser Collision]
        clearance --> crossing --> support
        collision --> terminate[Fail-Closed Termination]
    end

    reward --> v11_state
    v11_state --> ppo
